--[[
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    HUSTLEMETER v1.0.9 PRODUCTION
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

    lightweight gta online money ledger for cherax.

    description:
    - tracks positive gta online balance changes with real-life timestamps
    - tracks the authoritative active GTA$ balance with transition-safe reconciliation
    - shows rolling 1 day / 7 days earned totals with a gta-style hud
    - saves shared config under cherax\lua\hustlemeter
    - saves money history per Rockstar account + GTA edition under cherax\lua\hustlemeter\accounts
    - blocks story mode / singleplayer so it does not create a bad baseline
    - tracking remains read-only; optional Hard Cap Guard can block supported physical cash pickups before collection

    controls:
    - z shows the hud
    - triple z hides timed huds instantly; no timeout mode ignores repeated z presses
    - per-account tracking is automatic; Z/HUD always uses the logged-in Rockstar account
    - hud timeout (including no timeout), outline, x/y/scale are adjustable from the tab

    notes:
    - previous project name: MoneyCheck
    - run this script on startup for the cleanest rolling-window timestamps
    - do not close the script while tracking money in gta online
    - support diagnostics are captured automatically; Create Support ZIP packages them for bug reports
    - transition and suspicious-transaction diagnostics are saved under cherax\lua\hustlemeter\debug

    changelog:
    - v1.0.9 - Smart Heists removed by design due to developer request. HustleMeter no longer controls Silent Night or Codax heist cuts, presets, player percentages, cooldowns, or weekly heist multipliers.
    - v1.0.5 - confirmed LE/EE dual-wallet and multi-stage payout tracking, added safe legacy baseline recovery, fast streaming Support ZIP creation with Cherax.log, optional detailed payout capture, and Prime-safe deferred resets.
    - v1.0.4 - added transition-safe authoritative balance tracking, per-edition ledgers, automatic support diagnostics, and the original Support ZIP workflow.
    - v1.0.3 - added faster heist payout scanning and transition coverage.
    - v1.0.2 - added the persistent No timeout HUD option.
    - v1.0.1 - added automatic per-Rockstar-account ledgers and UI cleanup.
    - v1.0.0 - initial stable rolling 1 day / 7 day money tracking release.

    developed by: Public_Urinal
    credits: Built with assistance from ChatGPT.

    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
]]

